  "configuration_id": "config_047",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows single-profile scGPT RNA is much stronger than either image-only encoder (accuracy 0.411 vs 0.227/0.208; F1 0.378 vs 0.191/0.172), but it is unclear whether image features can add complementary signal when fused with RNA. config_047 keeps the strongest RNA encoder and single-profile setting, adds the better image-only encoder (ViT-L), and uses simple concat fusion, so it directly tests whether multimodal fusion improves over the RNA-only baseline without introducing multiprofile aggregation or weighted fusion. This is the best next step because it isolates the key modality/fusion question and will determine whether further multimodal complexity is worth the limited budget."
}

